{"id":"vod_sn_38735","vodId":"38735","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"重生计划","name_cn":"重生计划","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/67ef7889b9eb98b14e77b1670de7d2d6.jpg"},"summary":"海崎新太（小野贤章 配音）的人生在二十七岁之时走入了死胡同之中，工作仅三个月就选择辞职，两次参加考研却均无功而返，想要找一个可以糊口的工作却屡屡失败受挫，新太不知道也不想知道，究竟还会有什么在未来等待着他。　　某日，新太失魂落魄的走在街头，偶然遇见了一位名叫夜明了（木村良平 配音）的神秘男子，并邀请他参加一个看起来极为不祥的实验。在巨大的利益诱惑和保证能够找到工作的承诺面前，满腹疑虑的新太产生了动摇。按照要求，新太将要服下一颗神秘的药丸，之后，他的外表将会回到十七岁的样子，新太需要进入高中三年级就读，整个实验为期一年。就这样，新太回到了校园之中，在这里，等待着他的会是怎样的生活呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:04:11","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hQL6KxWGDi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/b3PJZBCt9N1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5YgGew6DNw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9GxgBzQ1b41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AmLTjLe1R21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2qYiTg0JTL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XuHyb67Yv71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Nn3ddeNBTz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/U9EvZBWuFY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/js9c6B8rqS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/X1h42nMyWG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/a5j5zz5svV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/36bx2TVHKn1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:55.424Z"}